One `hard` oracle has produced a verified certificate, so this exact ladder cannot ship at \(n=32\). The remaining two calls are still required evidence; afterward the harness will apply `escalate()`. At present that correctly reports the next size as cap-bound because the compact route would exceed 300 operations.
