+        "3. For each a=0,...,n-1 define",
+        "      L_a = scales[a] * sum_j (-1)^popcount(a AND labels[j]) y_j,",
+        "   where AND is bitwise AND and popcount is the number of 1 bits.",
+        "   Your certificate is valid exactly when f = sum_a L_a^[3].",
+        "",
